       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALL-SUBPROGRAM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 INPUT-NUMBER PIC 999 VALUE 7.
       01 SQUARE-RESULT PIC 9(6) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL "SQUARE-NUMBER" USING INPUT-NUMBER SQUARE-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "NUMBER: " INPUT-NUMBER.
           DISPLAY "SQUARE: " SQUARE-RESULT.
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM CALL-SUBPROGRAM.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SQUARE-NUMBER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 NUMBER-TO-SQUARE PIC 999.
       01 RESULT-VALUE PIC 9(6).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING NUMBER-TO-SQUARE RESULT-VALUE.
           COMPUTE RESULT-VALUE = NUMBER-TO-SQUARE *
               NUMBER-TO-SQUARE.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM SQUARE-NUMBER.
